  "notes": "{改良|かいりょう} focuses on making incremental improvements.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {品種|ひんしゅ}{改良|かいりょう} (breed improvement)\n- {土壌|どじょう}{改良|かいりょう} (soil improvement)\n- {改良|かいりょう}{版|ばん} (improved version)\n- {改良|かいりょう}を{加|くわ}える (add improvements)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {改善|かいぜん}: improvement (often organizational, systemic)\n- {改造|かいぞう}: remodeling, modification (structural changes)",
